    "summary": "S4 delivers durable lossless design-review history/publication and persistence-only recovery, all-inclusive checkpoint reservations, bounded sidecars/journals, version-aware readers/current IDE wire, independent current-evidence approval with truthful override, private-claim cleanup/recovery, and deterministic plus narrow real hosted qualification. CR round-one MEDs corrected and task-validated for t1 unfinished-prefix semantics and t7 nonblocking unsafe-file reads. T8 now defaults all normal MCP resilience scenarios to compiled modules and compiles both current code-review smoke routes; added both-party persistence retry/replay, live mutation invalidation and refusal/override-retention assertions. Nine compiled tests and 145 focused regressions pass; isolated production build/attestation passes without concurrent analyzer interference. Real t9 DEF-only Codex qualification and user-approved cleanup/history retrieval remain recorded; hosted HLD/LLD are not claimed. No production code changes under this T8 correction, no legacy activation or raw approval bypass.",
